# ...except a committed data snapshot so the dashboard has something to read on Streamlit
# Cloud, which only runs `pip install -r requirements.txt` + `streamlit run` -- it never runs
# the ingestion scripts or `dbt run`. The dashboard only queries materialized marts/intermediate
# tables (never the CSV-backed staging views), so the .duckdb file alone is sufficient -- verified
# by removing prices.csv/weather.csv locally and confirming the dashboard still rendered correctly.
!data/processed/celsio.duckdb

